<title>ITALY: Italy Senate to vote on budget Dec 19.</title>
<headline>Italy Senate to vote on budget Dec 19.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Italian Senate (upper house) will vote on the government's tough 1997 budget on the evening of December 19, parliamentary party leaders said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The package, which aims to slash 62.5 trillion lire ($41 billion) off next year's deficit, will be debated in the Senate from December 10.</p>
<p>It will then return to the Chamber of Deputies and must be passed by both houses by law before the end of the year. ($1=1,536 lire)</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 678 2501</p>
</text>
